  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 220°C/200°C fan-forced.\n• Place snacking tomatoes, thyme, the balsamic vinegar and a drizzle of olive oil on a lined oven tray.\n• Season to taste with salt and pepper and toss to combine. Roast until blistered, 15-20 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/689eaaef0fe946c7f5532513/step-f4cdbb00.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, bring a large saucepan of salted water to the boil.\n• Cook spaghetti pasta in the boiling water, stirring occasionally, until al dente, 10 minutes.\n• Reserve a cup of pasta water, then drain and return to saucepan. TIP: 'Al dente' pasta is cooked through but still slightly firm in the centre.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/689eaaef0fe946c7f5532513/step-5f8b2b10.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Finely chop garlic.\n• Return the saucepan to medium-high heat with a drizzle of olive oil. Add garlic and cook until fragrant, 1 minute.\n• Remove saucepan from heat. Add spaghetti, red pesto, a splash of the reserved pasta water and a pinch of chilli flakes (if using).\n• Add Parmesan cheese and toss to combine. Add baby spinach leaves and roasted tomatoes. Toss until combined and slightly wilted. Season to taste.\n• TIP: Seasoning is key in this dish, so taste and add a little more salt or pepper if you like!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/689eaaef0fe946c7f5532513/step-94507220.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide red pesto spaghetti between bowls.\n• Crumble over goat cheese to serve. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/689eaaef0fe946c7f5532513/step-9350e230.jpg"
    }
  ]
